---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在或已经移动。" noindex={true}>
	<section class="not-found">
		<p class="error-number">404</p>
		<div><p class="eyebrow">PAGE NOT FOUND</p><h1>这一页还不存在。</h1><p>链接可能已经改变，或这条笔记尚未生长出来。回到首页，或从全部文章重新开始。</p><div class="not-found-links"><a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a><a class="button" href="/blog/">全部文章</a><a class="button" href="/search/">搜索知识库</a></div></div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
	.not-found { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: center; gap: 32px; min-height: 62vh; padding: 40px 0; }
	.error-number { color: var(--line-strong); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 66px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
	h1 { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 28px; }
	.not-found div > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 480px; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.not-found-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-top: 18px; }
	@media (max-width: 600px) { .not-found { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; align-content: center; } .error-number { font-size: 48px; } }
</style>
